---
name: empty
type: registry:ui
title: Empty
description: Use the Empty component to display an empty state.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/index.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-header.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-header.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-media.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-media.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-media.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-media.variants.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-title.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-title.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-description.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-description.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/empty/empty-content.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/empty/empty-content.svelte'
---

Use empty for zero-data states. Compose `Empty.Header` with media, title, and description, then
optional actions in `Empty.Content`. Set `Empty.Media` `variant` to `icon` for a tinted icon shell.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import FolderIcon from '@lucide/svelte/icons/folder';
	import * as Empty from '~/components/empty';
	import { Button } from '~/components/button';
</script>

<Empty.Root>
	<Empty.Header>
		<Empty.Media variant="icon">
			<FolderIcon />
		</Empty.Media>
		<Empty.Title>No Projects Yet</Empty.Title>
		<Empty.Description>
			You haven't created any projects yet. Get started by creating your first project.
		</Empty.Description>
	</Empty.Header>
	<Empty.Content>
		<Button>Create Project</Button>
	</Empty.Content>
</Empty.Root>
```
